      "the_skinner_box_visual_frame_should_no": " The Skinner-box visual frame should not be adjacent to \"how to handle a kid in crisis\" content — different tonal space, different ethical weight. The Toolkit covers PBIS three-tier framework, replacement behaviors mapped to FBA functions, setting events (slow triggers most BIPs miss), Geoff Colvin's seven-phase Acting-Out Cycle for crisis de-escalation, and Restraint & Seclusion ethics anchored in Maine Chapter 33.",
