      "boiled_octopus_sliced_into_thin_rounds": "Boiled octopus sliced into thin rounds, served on wooden plates with smoked paprika, olive oil, sea salt, and boiled potatoes. The \"pulpeiras\" (octopus cooks) of Galicia are traditionally women who have inherited the technique across generations.",
      "bottlenose_dolphin": "Bottlenose Dolphin",
