      "curriculum_guide_5_day_unit_plan": "Curriculum Guide — 5-Day Unit Plan",
      "cuttlefish_change_their_skin_color_in_": "Cuttlefish change their skin color in seconds to match their background — a non-evolutionary form of camouflage that they can do because of specialized cells. Compare with what you saw: peppered moths and hares need MULTIPLE GENERATIONS to camouflage; cuttlefish do it in seconds.",
