      "each_campaign_has_3_to_4_feedback_rule": "Each campaign has 3 to 4 feedback rules that fire AFTER your actions resolve. They tie entities together. Wolves suppress deer (Conservation Manager). Beavers help salmon and brook trout (Watershed Steward). Clean grid unlocks transport electrification (Climate Pathways). Low working-age trust triggers vaccine refusal (Outbreak Response). Read the year-end review for which feedback rules fired this period; that is where the real strategy lives.",
      "each_ring_is_one_part_of_the_system_he": "each ring is one part of the system (🟢 healthy · 🟡 stressed · 🔴 critical). After a choice, lit spokes + ±deltas show how it rippled through.",
